---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Resource · Georgia's PsyWork">
{/* Resource header */}
<section class="flex flex-col gap-6.5 pb-section-sm pt-section-sm px-gutter-reading">
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 text-sm text-subtle"><a class="text-mint" href="/resources">Resources</a><span>/</span><span>Tool</span></div>
<h1 class="max-w-[14em] font-normal text-display text-balance leading-display tracking-display">Rota red flags: a 10-minute fatigue check</h1>
<p class="max-w-[32em] text-lead text-muted text-pretty leading-body">Twelve questions to run against your current rota. Each one points to a known source of fatigue risk, with a short note on why it matters and what to do next.</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mt-1.5">
<a class="px-7 py-4 font-semibold text-lg text-ground bg-amber rounded-xs hover:text-ground hover:bg-amber-hover" href="#">Download the checklist</a>
<a class="px-6.5 py-4 text-lg border border-brand-edge rounded-xs" href="#">Print version</a>
</div>
</section>
{/* Facts */}
<section class="pb-section-sm pt-0 px-gutter-reading">
<div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,180px),1fr))] border-b border-line border-t">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 pb-5.5 pl-0 pr-6 pt-5.5"><span class="text-2xs text-subtle tracking-label uppercase">Type</span><span class="text-xl">Tool</span></div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 pb-5.5 pl-0 pr-6 pt-5.5"><span class="text-2xs text-subtle tracking-label uppercase">Time needed</span><span class="text-xl">10 minutes</span></div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 pb-5.5 pl-0 pr-6 pt-5.5"><span class="text-2xs text-subtle tracking-label uppercase">Format</span><span class="text-xl">PDF · 4 pages</span></div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 pb-5.5 pl-0 pr-6 pt-5.5"><span class="text-2xs text-subtle tracking-label uppercase">Best for</span><span class="text-xl">Site and shift managers</span></div>
</div>
</section>
{/* Preview */}
<section class="pb-section pt-0 px-gutter">
<div class="flex aspect-[16/8] items-end p-4.5 text-2xs text-on-brand-muted tracking-label bg-brand rounded-sm">PREVIEW — CHECKLIST PAGES, VIDEO PLAYER OR TOOL EMBED</div>
</section>
{/* Inside */}
<section class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,200px),max-content)_minmax(0,760px))] gap-x-16 gap-y-6 pb-section pt-0 px-gutter-reading">
<span class="min-w-50 pt-2.5 text-sm text-mint tracking-label uppercase">What's inside</span>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<div class="grid grid-cols-[56px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-5 px-0 py-5.5 border-line border-t"><span class="text-lg text-amber tabular-nums">01</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><b class="font-semibold text-2xl">Shift length and sequence</b><span class="text-lg text-muted leading-body">Runs of nights, long shifts, and how many days people work before a rest.</span></div></div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-[56px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-5 px-0 py-5.5 border-line border-t"><span class="text-lg text-amber tabular-nums">02</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><b class="font-semibold text-2xl">Recovery between shifts</b><span class="text-lg text-muted leading-body">Quick returns, backward rotation and the first day after a changeover.</span></div></div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-[56px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-5 px-0 py-5.5 border-line border-t"><span class="text-lg text-amber tabular-nums">03</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><b class="font-semibold text-2xl">Cover and overtime</b><span class="text-lg text-muted leading-body">Who picks up the extra shifts, and how often it's the same people.</span></div></div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-[56px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-5 px-0 py-5.5 border-b border-line border-t"><span class="text-lg text-amber tabular-nums">04</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><b class="font-semibold text-2xl">High-risk tasks at low points</b><span class="text-lg text-muted leading-body">Where checks, driving and handovers fall against the 02:00–06:00 window.</span></div></div>
</div>
</section>
{/* How to use */}
<section class="flex flex-col gap-12 px-gutter py-section text-white bg-brand">
<div class="flex flex-col max-w-[820px] gap-4.5">
<p class="text-sm text-amber tracking-label uppercase">How to use it</p>
<h2 class="text-title-lg leading-title tracking-heading">Ten minutes, three steps</h2>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr))] gap-x-14 gap-y-10">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-7xl text-amber leading-none tabular-nums">00:00</span><h3 class="text-3xl">Pick one rota</h3><p class="text-lg text-on-brand leading-body">Use a real four-week pattern from one site or crew, not the template.</p></div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-7xl text-amber leading-none tabular-nums">00:02</span><h3 class="text-3xl">Work through the questions</h3><p class="text-lg text-on-brand leading-body">Answer honestly. Mark anything you're unsure of; that's often where the risk sits.</p></div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-7xl text-amber leading-none tabular-nums">00:10</span><h3 class="text-3xl">Read your flags</h3><p class="text-lg text-on-brand leading-body">Three or more is a pattern worth looking at with the people who work it.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
{/* Georgia note */}
<section class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,200px),max-content)_minmax(0,720px))] gap-x-16 gap-y-6 px-gutter-reading py-section">
<span class="min-w-50 pt-2.5 text-sm text-subtle tracking-label uppercase">Why we made this</span>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
<p class="italic text-lead-xl text-pretty leading-lead">"Most rotas I review are compliant. Very few have been checked for how tired people will actually be. This is the first ten minutes of that check."</p>
<p class="text-lg text-muted">Georgia Hodkinson GMBPsS</p>
</div>
</section>
{/* Related */}
<section class="flex flex-col gap-9 px-gutter py-section bg-deep">
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-x-10 gap-y-4">
<h2 class="text-quote tracking-heading">Use it alongside</h2>
<a class="text-lg text-mint border-b border-mint" href="/resources">All resources</a>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr))] gap-8">
<a class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 p-6.5 text-ink bg-surface border border-line-soft rounded-sm hover:text-ink hover:border-mint" href="/resource"><div class="flex justify-between text-xs tracking-label uppercase"><span class="text-mint">Video</span><span class="text-subtle">12 min</span></div><h3 class="text-3xl leading-heading">What 04:00 does to decision-making</h3><span class="text-sm text-amber">Watch →</span></a>
<a class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 p-6.5 text-ink bg-surface border border-line-soft rounded-sm hover:text-ink hover:border-mint" href="/resource"><div class="flex justify-between text-xs tracking-label uppercase"><span class="text-mint">Template</span><span class="text-subtle">Word · Excel</span></div><h3 class="text-3xl leading-heading">Shift handover template</h3><span class="text-sm text-amber">Download →</span></a>
<a class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 p-6.5 text-ink bg-surface border border-line-soft rounded-sm hover:text-ink hover:border-mint" href="/resource"><div class="flex justify-between text-xs tracking-label uppercase"><span class="text-mint">Tool</span><span class="text-subtle">Spreadsheet</span></div><h3 class="text-3xl leading-heading">The cost of turnover in shift roles</h3><span class="text-sm text-amber">Use the tool →</span></a>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
